      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "象征着春天终结的中距离GI比赛\n『宝冢纪念』,距离开赛的时间已经不多了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91db20cd28dac1060ef6132c95d77cd2bb706ea25f4f8fdaa1c337f67f5a4b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
