    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9c504fc9a56714bf3f3954",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就只会变得越来越不是对手。\n所以，无论如何我都要去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a99adf61c61e5370b88745f1af542bd8a2e964b58ea4f8749cf5e5a4c59a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed137a4bdde3e629b0372636",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一支箭不能战胜的对手。\n但是，有两支箭的话获胜的概率就会上升。\n一般来说是这样的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fcbb0b27fe949955e2aadae179261d573a9ab3254cefaa307ad5a34066d584",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62b95704574dc59b4f75016d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是这次我并不这么认为。\n反而我觉得可能会被一起打败。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ee942bafd664109efc3aae076250ab616d0c5cc17ded78e9175caccf722f2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
